    "limitations": "Bounded managed per-delivery completion and disjoint delivery/key failure isolation, plus managed/legacy cohort independence only. Shared-key failures may conservatively retry co-resident deliveries; no immutable claim reassignment or per-message object fanout. Legacy partial-write duplication, pre-capture process loss, logical-event/online/export reconciliation, quarantine/outbox, activation/retention/claim lifecycle, atomic erasure fence/ABA/journal/manifest races, historical/fold recovery and full W09/W22/customer/SLO/release scope remain open. Producer flag default-off, existing persisted schema/identifiers and native queue mapping unchanged. D06/D08/W24 boundaries remain. No commit/push/install/emitted build/provision/deploy/cloud/credentials/customer-data/destructive operations. Tracked whitespace does not cover inherited untracked delivery.ts; independent actual source inspection covers its two added subtype/comment lines and unchanged EOF. Frozen worker prose saying three added lines is a factual overcount, corrected by reviewer and root a3c49c; implementation and pass artifacts unchanged.",
